// Potential Powershell ReverseShell Connection | T1059.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_powershell_reverse_shell_connection.yml
((process.pe.original_file_name:(PowerShell.EXE OR pwsh.dll)) OR (process.executable.caseless:(*\\powershell.exe OR *\\pwsh.exe))) AND (process.command_line:*\ Net.Sockets.TCPClient* AND process.command_line:*.GetStream\(* AND process.command_line:*.Write\(*)
